 "result": "I documented 11 repos this run and refreshed state for a 12th.\n\nThe three new repos were 2026-11-22-orange-hubview, 2026-11-23-orange-explode and pipeline-builder. Eight existing repos got new entries: chromahum-zq, downfree-foundry, both Campus repos, pipe-weave, threat-atlas-v3, repofind and itchy-troll. Artifactium only had a gitignore commit, so I refreshed its state without writing docs. I pushed docs to all 11 and updated the profile page in sudosilo/sudosilo. Release jobs are in publish.json for the workflow to carry out.\n\nNo backfills remain apart from control-troll, heckle-troll and sudosilo, which stay out of the queue on purpose. Six repos with new commits hit the cap of 12 and wait for the next run. They are the testbed, packets, blue-agent, conveyor-sim, field-twin and mohavetech-website.\n\nI could reach every repo. pipeline-builder answers with a Vercel login redirect at its own name, so its live link points to pipeline-builder-azure-kappa instead.\n\nI added this run's notes to agents/notes/general.md. The state, repos, publish and notes files are pushed to control-troll main.",
